        <td>Budget-driven remodel / builder spec / fast turnaround</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<h2>What's the same across all three</h2>
<p>All three brands are built by <strong>W.W. Wood Products</strong> in Dudley, Missouri (10411 Brenda St., Dudley, MO 63936), ship on the same ~6 week production cycle, and share Pinnacle Sales' design, ordering, and claims support. WW Wood is family-owned, founded in 1977, with 6 plants and ~800 employees — one of the top three privately held cabinet manufacturers in the United States.</p>

<p>That means a designer running a job with two of the three brands gets one delivery, one acknowledgment, one rep on call, and one warranty process. The dealer portal is the same (my.wwinc.com), the Blum TANDEM drawer guide is the same, the catalyzed conversion varnish topcoat is the same.</p>

<p>This is one of the strongest things a rep can lead with: "You can mix Shiloh and Eclipse in the same house — primary kitchen and a contemporary basement bar — and they ship together on one acknowledgment."</p>

<h2>Next steps after a walkthrough</h2>
<ul class="next-steps">
  <li><strong>Request samples:</strong> Door samples and color chips go out from the WW Wood sample program — ask your rep to place the order during or right after the call.</li>
  <li><strong>Showroom display:</strong> If the dealer doesn't have brand merchandising yet, point them at the <a href="/playbook/eclipse-merchandiser-display">Eclipse Merchandiser Display</a> and <a href="/playbook/profitable-kitchen-showroom-display">profitable showroom display</a> playbook articles.</li>
  <li><strong>Spec & quote:</strong> Pinnacle's 2020/ProKitchen support team can review the first design — see <a href="/dealer-hub/support">Support & Escalation</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>Train the rest of the team:</strong> Schedule a recorded virtual walkthrough so newer designers can watch on demand. Contact <a href="mailto:marketing@pinnaclesales.biz">marketing@pinnaclesales.biz</a>.</li>
</ul>

</DealerHubLayout>

<style>
  .page-subtitle { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 70ch; margin-top: -0.5rem; }
  .how-to-use {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .how-to-use p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .how-to-use p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .dive-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .dive-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .dive-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .dive-card-image img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .dive-card-body { padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .dive-tier {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .dive-card-body h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
  .dive-construction { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-muted); margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
  .dive-sweet-spot { font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; flex: 1; }
  .dive-link { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-dark); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-accent); align-self: flex-start; }

  .compare-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem; }
  .compare-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .compare-table th, .compare-table td {
    text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); vertical-align: top;
  }
  .compare-table thead th {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-black);
  }
  .compare-table tbody th {
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-muted); width: 9rem;
  }
  .verify {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #b45309; background: #fef3c7; padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 3px; margin-left: 0.3rem; vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .next-steps { margin: 1rem 0 2rem; }
  .next-steps li { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .dive-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .dive-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .compare-table { font-size: 0.82rem; }
    .compare-table th, .compare-table td { padding: 0.55rem 0.5rem; }
    .compare-table tbody th { width: auto; }
  }
</style>
